ative by the Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab, in the Conference Room, First Floor, Block-B, Plot No. 3, Madhya Marg, Sector 18-A, Chandigarh, on 24.03.2026 at 2.30 pm. In the event of failure to submit a proper reply, non-appearance for hearing, or submission of an incomplete response, the Authority may be constrained to take appropriate action, including rejection of the application for registration of real estate agent , without granting any further opportunity',2,0,'DirectorIT','2026-03-16 09:48:17.000','DirectorIT','2026-03-16 09:48:17.000'),(44802,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-03-16 09:49:14.000',10968,'REA20260113','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-03-16 09:49:18.765','','2026-03-16 09:49:18.765',0,'','The application filed by you for registration of the agent is found to be incomplete. After examining the application, observations have been shared with you on your dashboard available on web portal of the authority. Therefore, your application is being returned with a notice that why your application may not be rejected due to the deficiencies pointed in the observations. You are hereby given an opportunity as per proviso 2 to sub-section 3 of Section 9 of the RERD Act, 2016 of being heard. Further, you are also given an opportunity to remove the deficiencies, inaccuracies and submit proper documents online within 5 days of this return of application. Further, you are hereby given an opportunity of being heard in person or through your representative by the Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab, in the Conference Room, First Floor, Block-B, Plot No. 3, Madhya Marg, Sector 18-A, Chandigarh, on 24.03.2026 at 2.30 pm. In the event of failure to submit a proper reply, non-appearance for hearing, or submission of an incomplete response, the Authority may be constrained to take appropriate action, including rejection of the application for registra