 of real estate agent , without granting any further opportunity',2,0,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:28:30.000','DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:28:30.000'),(45087,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:29:41.000',10194,'REA20250220','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-03-25 15:29:42.101','','2026-03-25 15:29:42.101',0,'','As per the request of the applicant the application is sent back for attending to the observations in the checklist',2,0,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:29:41.000','DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:29:41.000'),(45088,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:30:53.000',10983,'REA20260116','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-03-25 15:30:54.756','','2026-03-25 15:30:54.756',0,'','As per the request of the applicant the application is sent back to the applicant for attending to the observations in the checklist',2,0,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:30:53.000','DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:30:53.000'),(45089,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:32:13.000',10945,'REA20260093','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-03-25 15:32:14.521','','2026-03-25 15:32:14.521',0,'','As per the request of the applicant the application is returned back for attending to the observations in the checklist',2,0,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:32:13.000','DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:32:13.000'),(45090,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-03-25 15:34:10.000',10684,'REA20250508','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-03-25 15:34:11.620','','2026-03-25 15:34:11.620',0,'','As per the request of the applicant the application is returned back for attending to the observations in the checklist ',2,0,'Directo