 18-A, Chandigarh, on 12.05.2026 at 2.30 pm. In the event of failure to submit a proper reply, non-appearance for hearing, or submission of an incomplete response, the Authority may be constrained to take appropriate action, including rejection of the application for registration as a real estate agent, without granting any further opportunity',1,0,'DirectorIT','2026-04-28 11:29:00.000','DirectorIT','2026-04-28 11:29:00.000'),(46381,220005,'DirectorIT','2026-04-28 11:41:24.000',9676,'REA20240313','','','Authority Desk','Application Not Accepted (Rejected)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-04-28 11:41:24.897','','2026-04-28 11:41:24.897',0,'','Application rejected vide office memo no 718 dated 15.01.26',1,0,'DirectorIT','2026-04-28 11:41:24.000','DirectorIT','2026-04-28 11:41:24.000'),(46382,220053,'OSadmin1.rera','2026-04-28 11:53:44.000',11066,'REA20260164','','','Authority Desk','Marked for Rejection','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2026-04-28 11:53:44.309','','2026-04-28 11:53:44.309',0,'','The last date was 16.04.2026, given to the applicant to remove the deficiencies. However, some mistakes have been the same. One more opportunity was given to the applicant, but he had failed to complete the documents. Kindly put up to the Authority for rejection.',1,0,'OSadmin1.rera','2026-04-28 11:53:44.000','OSadmin1.rera','2026-04-28 11:53:44.000'),(46383,220053,'OSadmin1.rera','2026-04-28 12:03:41.000',11064,'REA20260163','','','Authority Desk','Marked for Rejection','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2026-04-28 12:03:41.774','','2026-04-28 12:03:41.774',0,'','The last date was 16.04.2026, given to the applicant to remove the deficiencies. However, some mistakes have been the same. One more opportunity was given to the applicant, but he had failed to complete the documents. Kindly put up to the Authority for rejection.',1,0,'OSadmin1.rera','2026-04-28 12:03:41.000','OSadmin1.rera','2026-04-28 12:03:41.000'),(46384,220053,'OSadmin1.rera','2