60,220006,'OSadmin1.rera','2026-05-11 15:33:18.000',11044,'REA20260173','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2026-05-11 15:33:22.315','','2026-05-11 15:33:22.315',0,'','The applicant has visited and requested for one last opportunity. May consider',1,0,'OSadmin1.rera','2026-05-11 15:33:18.000','OSadmin1.rera','2026-05-11 15:33:18.000'),(46761,220004,'999','2026-05-11 16:16:57.000',10940,'REA20260218','Application Re-Submitted(Modified Application)','Application submiited by Real Estate Agent with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Application Re-Submitted with Modification','Role RealEstate Agent','HelpDesk Level I','2026-05-11 16:16:57.000','999','2026-05-11 16:16:57.000',1,'In Process','Application Re-Submitted(Modified Application)',1,0,'sysadmin','2026-05-11 16:16:57.000','sysadmin','2026-05-11 16:16:57.000'),(46762,220006,'DyDirector1','2026-05-11 16:35:18.000',11087,'REA20260212','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2026-05-11 16:35:21.991','','2026-05-11 16:35:21.991',0,'','The applicant has requested for change of constitution from indiividual to other than individual and is ready tomake the additional payment as per email.',2,0,'DyDirector1','2026-05-11 16:35:18.000','DyDirector1','2026-05-11 16:35:18.000'),(46763,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-05-11 16:41:58.000',11087,'REA20260212','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-05-11 16:42:01.450','','2026-05-11 16:42:01.450',0,'','As per the request of the applicant the application is returned back for changing the profile',2,0,'DirectorIT','2026-05-11 16:41:58.000','DirectorIT','2026-05-11 16:41:58.000'),(46764,220007,'DirectorIT','2026-05-11 16:50:01.000',11087,'REA20260212','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8b